This directory has short example scripts for pair_style uma (ML-UMA).

UMA model weights are NOT shipped with LAMMPS (FAIR Chemistry License).
Export a FP64 TorchScript artifact from a user-supplied FairChem checkpoint
before running. pair_coeff names that artifact directory.

  python src/ML-UMA/uma-engine/python/export_artifact.py \
    --checkpoint $UMA_CHECKPOINT --dtype float64 --task omat \
    --output /path/to/uma-s-1p2-omat-f64

Then, from this directory, with LAMMPS built -D PKG_ML-UMA=on:

  lmp -in in.nacl.nvt -var uma_art /path/to/uma-s-1p2-omat-f64
  lmp -in in.nacl.npt -var uma_art /path/to/uma-s-1p2-omat-f64

in.nacl.nvt
  NaCl rocksalt 3x3x3 (216 atoms), 10-step NVT at 300 K.
  pair_style uma precision double, newton off.

in.nacl.npt
  Same crystal, 10-step NPT. virial auto (the default) enables the
  strain-gradient virial when the barostat is present; ac must stay off.

Do not launch with -k on or -sf kk. There is no uma/kk style.
Graph-parallel uses one MPI rank per GPU and devices 1 (the default):

  mpiexec -n 12 lmp -in in.nacl.nvt -var uma_art /path/to/uma-s-1p2-omat-f64

No log.* files are included: the example cannot run in default LAMMPS CI
without LibTorch and a user artifact.
